Now, of course, when you start to consider making more switches, that complexity goes up quite fast, let's just say.

4586
04:24:08,520 --> 04:24:13,200
Because now, all of a sudden, you need to somehow affect both of these circuits with the next one.

4587
04:24:14,840 --> 04:24:16,320
And that sounds like hell.

4588
04:24:17,180 --> 04:24:18,420
That doesn't sound good.

4589
04:24:19,020 --> 04:24:19,760
Sounds bad.

4590
04:24:20,360 --> 04:24:21,800
It sounds real bad.

4591
04:24:21,940 --> 04:24:23,200
This is definitely a one-shot.

4592
04:24:23,480 --> 04:24:26,580
This is a golden one-hit wonder, you know?

4593
04:24:28,840 --> 04:24:31,700
But yeah, it's a good practice, though.

4594
04:24:32,140 --> 04:24:33,460
I learned some good stuff from this.

4595
04:24:34,780 --> 04:24:38,280
And... There.

4596
04:24:39,680 --> 04:24:40,800
We ended right there.

4597
04:24:48,290 --> 04:24:49,010
Oh, man.

4598
04:24:49,670 --> 04:24:50,430
That was tough.

4599
04:24:53,470 --> 04:24:58,170
That was an entire stream of me struggling with Redstone.

4600
04:24:59,090 --> 04:25:00,030
How about that?

4601
04:25:02,370 --> 04:25:04,290
Probably not the most exciting thing for some of you.

4602
04:25:05,430 --> 04:25:09,950
But I'm guessing the ones who are still left right now may have thought it was exciting.

4603
04:25:10,150 --> 04:25:11,110
The rest, not so much.

4604
04:25:14,160 --> 04:25:16,180
It was frustrating, but it was also fun for me.

4605
04:25:20,360 --> 04:25:22,420
And getting four blaze rods, you're right.

4606
04:25:22,560 --> 04:25:24,100
I did actually go to the nether.

4607
04:25:24,340 --> 04:25:24,660
True.

4608
04:25:29,540 --> 04:25:31,900
I think I would have cried tonight if I didn't make it work.

4609
04:25:32,020 --> 04:25:36,640
If I ended a stream without having made that work, I would die inside.

4610
04:25:38,460 --> 04:25:39,960
I'm zoning out up in the middle.

4611
04:25:40,100 --> 04:25:40,560
Makes sense.

4612
04:25:45,460 --> 04:25:47,520
You finished a game listening to me?

4613
04:25:47,920 --> 04:25:49,460
Talking about carrots.

4614
04:25:51,700 --> 04:25:53,420
What prediction did you guys have?

4615
04:25:53,880 --> 04:25:54,960
Is it a spoiler?

4616
04:25:55,420 --> 04:25:56,600
I'm kind of curious.

4617
04:26:03,420 --> 04:26:04,120
No spoiler.

4618
04:26:05,860 --> 04:26:06,680
I want to see it.

4619
04:26:08,660 --> 04:26:11,480
By the way, I keep forgetting to press the add button whenever I take a break.

4620
04:26:11,580 --> 04:26:13,600
I really should learn that.

4621
04:26:14,220 --> 04:26:17,860
Because that means you won't get ads when I'm not on the break.

4622
04:26:18,040 --> 04:26:19,000
Like, for a long time.

4623
04:26:19,320 --> 04:26:21,580
So me forgetting that is actually bad for everyone.

4624
04:26:23,040 --> 04:26:24,020
So I'm sorry about that.

4625
04:26:31,490 --> 04:26:35,110
You also have some explaining to do after last Minecraft stream.

4626
04:26:35,250 --> 04:26:36,310
Remember that sign change?

4627
04:26:37,550 --> 04:26:39,610
You mean I changed the language?

4628
04:26:41,590 --> 04:26:43,530
It used to be Danish, now it's German, yeah.

4629
04:26:44,690 --> 04:26:46,010
I mean, I don't know.

4630
04:26:46,150 --> 04:26:47,250
I speak both languages.

4631
04:26:47,250 --> 04:26:48,450
It made sense at the time.

4632
04:26:56,910 --> 04:27:03,490
By the way, speaking of the Elder Ring things, not that we spoke about it, but I love saying that even though nobody said anything about it, you know?

4633
04:27:03,690 --> 04:27:07,450
You have a conversation in real life about, I don't know, zebras?

4634
04:27:07,790 --> 04:27:10,390
You know, the ones with the bright colors or whatever?

4635
04:27:10,890 --> 04:27:11,590
Black and white?

4636
04:27:12,090 --> 04:27:16,350
All of a sudden you go, speaking of graphics cards, you go up on that.

4637
04:27:16,790 --> 04:27:17,830
I know, it's just funny to me.

4638
04:27:18,310 --> 04:27:20,550
But the Elder Ring stuff, did you guys get any further with that?

4639
04:27:21,190 --> 04:27:22,350
I know Jen was on it.

4640
04:27:23,710 --> 04:27:24,550
You figured it out?

4641
04:27:27,360 --> 04:27:28,440
The Elden Ring stuff.

4642
04:27:30,200 --> 04:27:31,020
Oh, okay.

4643
04:27:32,560 --> 04:27:33,320
I see.

4644
04:27:38,420 --> 04:27:42,380
If you're still working on it and you've actually tried, you may be missing something obvious.

4645
04:27:42,620 --> 04:27:44,560
Because it's really not deep at all.

4646
04:27:45,860 --> 04:27:47,820
It's really, really dumb.

4647
04:27:49,160 --> 04:27:53,860
It's like... super... I don't even know, basic.

4648
04:27:54,740 --> 04:27:57,860
So you're probably overthinking something at this point if you're still going.

4649
04:27:59,560 --> 04:28:00,900
That would be my advice there.

4650
04:28:02,890 --> 04:28:05,190
I did throw a wrench in the works with it, though.

4651
04:28:05,470 --> 04:28:10,350
There was one very nasty little bit that may trip you up.

4652
04:28:16,150 --> 04:28:21,530
All I want to say is think about rotation on individual characters, okay?

4653
04:28:24,050 --> 04:28:24,970
I've said enough.

4654
04:28:25,610 --> 04:28:27,210
You should be able to get it now.

4655
04:28:28,200 --> 04:28:31,220
Do you ever have to fight the temptation to watch Minecraft videos?

4656
04:28:31,840 --> 04:28:34,740
No, I never have a temptation to watch Minecraft videos.

4657
04:28:39,080 --> 04:28:41,480
Oliver, can I just say how brilliant your content is?

4658
04:28:41,600 --> 04:28:42,200
You're incredible.

4659
04:28:42,340 --> 04:28:43,040
Be proud of yourself.

4660
04:28:43,180 --> 04:28:43,900
Thank you, man!

4661
04:28:44,640 --> 04:28:45,920
That's so nice of you to say.

4662
04:28:48,360 --> 04:28:49,180
That's super nice.

4663
04:28:49,340 --> 04:28:50,100
Thank you very much.

4664
04:28:51,160 --> 04:28:52,240
I'm glad you think so.

4665
04:28:53,000 --> 04:28:55,640
I mean, I'm just sitting here playing my games, you know?

4666
04:28:56,080 --> 04:28:57,620
I'm glad people find that entertaining.

4667
04:28:59,140 --> 04:29:04,020
I guess the entertaining part of it is that when I speak out loud and voice my thoughts...

4668
04:29:04,800 --> 04:29:07,820
I kind of distract myself from my original thought process.

4669
04:29:08,220 --> 04:29:19,660
The act of speaking, moving my mouth, you know, moving air around, it kind of messes up my rhythm a little bit, and I lose track of what I was thinking about.

4670
04:29:21,300 --> 04:29:32,680
I promise, if I were to play this game without talking out loud, I'm pretty sure I would figure things out way more fast, or way more quickly, and I wouldn't get distracted as much.

4671
04:29:34,520 --> 04:29:35,800
The cake incident.

4672
04:29:36,040 --> 04:29:36,420
Exactly.

4673
04:29:36,780 --> 04:29:37,180
Yeah.

4674
04:29:39,160 --> 04:29:43,460
I would still remember what I was doing when I went up to my house if I wasn't saying anything out loud.

4675
04:29:43,580 --> 04:29:49,220
I think I have a problem in my mind that I just can't multitask like that.

4676
04:29:51,300 --> 04:29:53,640
Streaming has sabotaged Minecraft.

4677
04:29:54,160 --> 04:29:56,100
But also, I guess, made it kind of entertaining.

4678
04:29:56,240 --> 04:29:57,940
People think it's funny, you know, sometimes.

4679
04:29:58,280 --> 04:30:00,040
But also frustrating at the same time.

4680
04:30:00,580 --> 04:30:01,820
You could say the cake was a lie.

4681
04:30:02,420 --> 04:30:02,920
Nice one.

4682
04:30:10,250 --> 04:30:14,230
Would you like a resource pack that replaces the button sound effect with Jim?

4683
04:30:19,390 --> 04:30:20,290
Actually, yes.

4684
04:30:21,290 --> 04:30:22,290
Can you make that?

4685
04:30:23,430 --> 04:30:24,870
That would be incredible.

4686
04:30:27,430 --> 04:30:28,510
I would love that.

4687
04:30:33,210 --> 04:30:38,330
Can you somehow make it so that it only happens at 25% of the time I click the button?

4688
04:30:38,530 --> 04:30:39,070
Is that a thing?

4689
04:30:41,090 --> 04:30:42,090
Nah, that's probably weird.

4690
04:30:42,170 --> 04:30:43,490
Just put it 100%.

4691
04:30:43,490 --> 04:30:44,370
Jim.

4692
04:30:49,730 --> 04:30:50,550
I would love that.

4693
04:30:50,710 --> 04:30:51,010
Thank you.

4694
04:30:51,130 --> 04:30:51,830
Yeah, please do.

4695
04:30:52,030 --> 04:30:54,410
Put it in the channel-related... well, channel.

4696
04:30:54,630 --> 04:30:55,210
On Discord.

4697
04:30:58,290 --> 04:30:59,810
I can make one with any other clips.

4698
04:30:59,890 --> 04:31:00,490
No, just that.

4699
04:31:00,590 --> 04:31:01,270
That one is great.

4700
04:31:01,290 --> 04:31:01,830
I love that.

4701
04:31:02,810 --> 04:31:04,170
We could have it for one stream on.

4702
04:31:04,350 --> 04:31:04,450
Yeah.

4703
04:31:05,470 --> 04:31:05,970
Sounds great.

4704
04:31:07,770 --> 04:31:08,290
Oh, yeah.

4705
04:31:08,410 --> 04:31:09,530
Tie it to a specific button.

4706
04:31:09,710 --> 04:31:10,430
That would be great.

4707
04:31:11,490 --> 04:31:13,430
You know, like there's stone buttons, wood buttons, all that.

4708
04:31:15,270 --> 04:31:16,850
Make it the stone button, if you can.

4709
04:31:19,800 --> 04:31:21,220
I would really appreciate that.

4710
04:31:21,340 --> 04:31:22,260
That sounds hilarious.

4711
04:31:24,640 --> 04:31:25,920
Of course that's possible.

4712
04:31:33,410 --> 04:31:33,810
Francesco.

4713
04:31:34,330 --> 04:31:37,070
Oliver, I'm very happy that I found you on YouTube almost a year ago.

4714
04:31:37,270 --> 04:31:39,470
You play Minecraft in a way that almost no one does.

4715
04:31:40,530 --> 04:31:42,530
I can see that as a good or bad thing.

4716
04:31:42,730 --> 04:31:46,050
You discovered so much stuff without outside help, and I love your positivity.

4717
04:31:47,530 --> 04:31:48,650
Okay, so, listen.

4718
04:31:48,790 --> 04:31:55,870
In the very beginning of Minecraft, yes, it was sort of a challenge I put on myself, because I didn't expect to end up liking the game that much.

4719
04:31:56,570 --> 04:31:59,290
I was just like, okay, Minecraft is a wiki game, right?

4720
04:31:59,990 --> 04:32:01,610
Let me just try for fun and beat it.

4721
04:32:01,930 --> 04:32:02,570
See if I can do it.

4722
04:32:02,910 --> 04:32:04,650
Like, I don't even know what this game is about, right?

4723
04:32:05,210 --> 04:32:08,850
But very quickly, it sort of just became me wanting to play the game, and that's it.

4724
04:32:09,990 --> 04:32:16,550
It's not like... Maybe after, like, five hours, it wasn't about trying to beat it without outside help anymore.

4725
04:32:16,550 --> 04:32:17,990
It was just me enjoying the game.

4726
04:32:18,750 --> 04:32:20,870
I just had fun with the game I was playing, you know?

4727
04:32:21,470 --> 04:32:23,570
The way I was playing it, and I just kept doing it.

4728
04:32:23,830 --> 04:32:26,350
It's not like I'm trying to do some kind of challenge or anything.

4729
04:32:27,240 --> 04:32:32,540
It's not like I secretly want to be looking things up online or anything as a challenge.

4730
04:32:32,860 --> 04:32:34,860
I enjoy this experience, you know?

4731
04:32:36,460 --> 04:32:39,620
I got this game, I paid for it, I'm playing it.

4732
04:32:42,720 --> 04:32:47,780
Maybe that's oversimplifying a bit, but... I'm glad it's very appealing to you.

4733
04:32:53,460 --> 04:32:56,240
There was one moment in stream where Chad freaked out massively.

4734
04:32:56,500 --> 04:32:57,900
Can't say where though because spoilers.

4735
04:32:58,180 --> 04:32:58,500
Good!

4736
04:32:59,320 --> 04:33:00,060
I'm happy.

4737
04:33:00,220 --> 04:33:01,560
I love when you guys freak out.

4738
04:33:15,020 --> 04:33:15,500
Okay.

4739
04:33:16,020 --> 04:33:18,080
We're going insane with the Elden Ring thing?

4740
04:33:18,240 --> 04:33:18,660
Okay, listen.

4741
04:33:19,320 --> 04:33:21,800
I'm gonna give the biggest hint, and I'm not gonna say any more.

4742
04:33:22,900 --> 04:33:25,040
Think about... I think I said it before.

4743
04:33:25,680 --> 04:33:27,620
Think about rotation, okay?

4744
04:33:27,840 --> 04:33:28,580
About characters.

4745
04:33:29,360 --> 04:33:30,900
Some of them may be rotated.

4746
04:33:31,820 --> 04:33:32,300
Okay?

4747
04:33:32,540 --> 04:33:33,340
That's all I'm saying.

4748
04:33:34,600 --> 04:33:36,180
There's one really nasty one.

4749
04:33:37,080 --> 04:33:38,480
Think outside the box a little bit.

4750
04:33:41,330 --> 04:33:43,690
Maybe it's rotated in a very specific way.

4751
04:33:47,270 --> 04:33:48,410
That fools you.

4752
04:33:48,690 --> 04:33:49,930
What is this Elden Ring thing?

4753
04:33:50,270 --> 04:33:57,090
That's just a little funny puzzle thing I put in the intro screen of the Elden Ring stream.

4754
04:33:58,450 --> 04:33:59,630
Just for the kick of it.

4755
04:34:02,490 --> 04:34:04,270
Guys, you don't need to match any fonts.

4756
04:34:04,730 --> 04:34:06,110
Don't even go that way.

4757
04:34:06,230 --> 04:34:07,810
It's way over-complicating it.

4758
04:34:12,480 --> 04:34:13,540
Still missing the order?

4759
04:34:13,660 --> 04:34:14,940
Think about the most logical order.

4760
04:34:15,140 --> 04:34:15,540
Left to right.

4761
04:34:16,100 --> 04:34:17,300
Up to down.

4762
04:34:19,780 --> 04:34:20,680
Don't go crazy.

4763
04:34:22,280 --> 04:34:24,920
Assume the simplest possible explanation, okay?

4764
04:34:27,840 --> 04:34:29,880
You know what you guys are doing right now?

4765
04:34:29,960 --> 04:34:31,600
You're doing exactly what I do in Minecraft.

4766
04:34:31,860 --> 04:34:32,960
I overthink things.

4767
04:34:33,600 --> 04:34:36,840
When things should... and are, most of the time, very simple.

4768
04:34:44,730 --> 04:34:46,010
Ha ha ha ha ha.

4769
04:34:59,630 --> 04:35:00,350
Okay, guys.

4770
04:35:01,250 --> 04:35:02,190
I'm gonna end it here.

4771
04:35:03,470 --> 04:35:04,350
It's a good time.

4772
04:35:05,750 --> 04:35:06,950
I'm really tired, actually.

4773
04:35:07,050 --> 04:35:08,010
This was a long day for me.

4774
04:35:09,530 --> 04:35:13,110
Fucking running from the station to get back home in time to start streaming.

4775
04:35:13,650 --> 04:35:14,630
You guys are the best.

4776
04:35:14,870 --> 04:35:18,390
Thanks for being here, and then... Enduring my Redstone shenanigans.

4777
04:35:18,750 --> 04:35:19,990
I'm glad you're enjoying it.

4778
04:35:22,750 --> 04:35:26,130
And look forward to more Elden Ring and Cyberpunk and also more Minecraft.

4779
04:35:26,370 --> 04:35:28,050
It's gonna be a hell of a time coming up.

4780
04:35:28,610 --> 04:35:29,410
I can't wait.

4781
04:35:29,730 --> 04:35:30,350
Have a good night.

4782
04:35:30,950 --> 04:35:31,350
Ciao!
